{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"よう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は靴2足買って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは\nライブリハに合流"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と\n充実してたよー＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど帰りに雨降ってて萎えた(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のライブリハも、\n8thシングルイベントのアンダーライブの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/3も、もうそろそろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして17日\n名古屋も追加募集開始してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月1日(水)必着分まで有効だよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ！\n今すぐポストへ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ見てくれたかたで\n生で見たいと\n一緒にあの空気を共有したいと思ってくれたかたも是非来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『死の実況中継』以来\n映画観てないや～\n時間できたらなんかしら観に行く`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直あんまりラーメン食べないから\nどっちが好きかよくわかんない(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば最近はやってないね～\n中田が可愛いと思うアイドルってだいたい\n黒髪ストレートがすごい似合う子だから\n憧れに近づきたいって感じなのかなー`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部答えれなくてごめんね(´・ω・`)\nあと、\n既出のもの以外を優先してます\n前のブログとかを漁ってみて～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて！\nまだ貼れてなかった写メ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイプラライブでご一緒させてもらった\nマボロシ可憐GeNEさん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっちさん、あおやんさん、ゆみのんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マボカレポーズで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マボカレさん\n元気いっぱいで可愛かったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/30/0917937/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nあおやんさん\n乃木坂好きでいてくれてるみたいで嬉しい(*°-°*)\n乃木坂にあおやんさん欲しいです、ください`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}